.Dd September 3, 2026
.Dt VDOTS-CTL 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm vdots-ctl
.Nd runtime health check for the live Neovim config
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Ic check
.Op Fl -json
.Nm
.Ic update
.Op Ar opts
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm Ic check
runs
.Ic nvim --headless +checkhealth ,
writes the full report to a temp file, and summarises the
.Ic ERROR
and
.Ic WARNING
counts.
.Fl -json
emits
.Ic { status , warnings , errors , raw_file } .
.Pp
.Nm Ic update
forwards to
.Xr vdots-update 1 .
.Pp
Contrast
.Xr vdots-doctor 1 ,
the static check of the install and read-aloud helpers.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr vdots 1 ,
.Xr vdots-doctor 1 ,
.Xr vdots-update 1
